{"id": "07", "model": "eleven_v4", "lines": [{"speaker": "TIP", "text": "[glitching] T-T-TIP: Too many respawns make the s-s-save file... heavy. [pause] The world is starting to... l-l-lag."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[nervous] Lag? Real life can't lag."}, {"speaker": "MOM", "text": "[stuttering, glitchy] Good m-m-m-morning, sw-sw-sweetie!"}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "Birds froze in the sky. The school bus kept teleporting back to the same corner. [pause] And Dad's pancake... just... stayed up there."}, {"speaker": "DAD", "text": "[confused, looking up] Huh. [pause] That one's... thinking about it."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "And then... the whole street switched to low graphics."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[panicking] Why does everything look like it's from two thousand and six?!"}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "And the respawns... started going wrong."}, {"speaker": "SYSTEM", "text": "[glitchy] Respawning in three, two, one."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[hugging the pole] This is NOT my checkpoint!"}, {"speaker": "SYSTEM", "text": "Respawning."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[tiny, underwater, bubbly] Hi, Gary."}, {"speaker": "SYSTEM", "text": "Respawning."}, {"speaker": "COACH", "text": "[confused] ...Are you a ball now?"}, {"speaker": "SYSTEM", "text": "Respawning."}, {"speaker": "TEACHER", "text": "[deadpan] ...That was my birthday cake."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "You respawned in Mr. Fig's birthday cake. [pause] To this day, nobody knows how."}], "voice_segments": [{"voice_id": "IKne3meq5aSn9XLyUdCD", "start_time_seconds": 0.0, "end_time_seconds": 8.16, "character_start_index": 0, "character_end_index": 116, "dialogue_input_index": 0}, {"voice_id": "TX3LPaxmHKxFdv7VOQHJ", "start_time_seconds": 8.16, "end_time_seconds": 10.887, "character_start_index": 116, "character_end_index": 151, "dialogue_input_index": 1}, {"voice_id": "EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL", "start_time_seconds": 10.887, "end_time_seconds": 13.600000000000001, "character